t-native-app-with-mobile-center","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Shell","description":"Install mobile center to a blank react native app to demonstrate how `react-native link` works","topics":[],"score":186764,"global_rank":395353},{"name":"kylerlittle/battleship-c","owner":"kylerlittle","html_url":"https://github.com/kylerlittle/battleship-c","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"C","description":"This program runs the game of Battleship. The game guides the user through the game until player 1 or 2 has sunk all of the other player's ships. The objective of the game is to guess where the other player's ships are hidden and sink them. Additionally, once the game is over, the player can view a summary of the game in battleship.log. Written in October 2016.","topics":[],"score":186764,"global_rank":395354},{"name":"kylerlittle/line-sim","owner":"kylerlittle","html_url":"https://github.com/kylerlittle/line-sim","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"C","description":"This program simulates two lines in a grocery store as two queues. There are Normal & Express \"lines.\" The arrival and service times for each customer are randomly generated. Enqueues and dequeues are made as necessary. The simulation runs for 'n' minutes (inputted by user). Various information is printed out as the simulation runs. Written in February 2017.","topics":[],"score":186764,"global_rank":395358},{"name":"spenczar/go-gh-releaser","owner":"spenczar","html_url":"https://github.com/spenczar/go-gh-releaser","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Go","description":"Utility to cross-compile Go programs and publish them to github releases.","topics":[],"score":186764,"global_rank":395362},{"name":"EmeraldCityIT/Use-of-Induction-Heating-in-HydroElectric-Generators-to-Increase-Output","owner":"EmeraldCityIT","html_url":"https://github.com/EmeraldCityIT/Use-of-Induction-Heating-in-HydroElectric-Generators-to-Increase-Output","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Efficiency of modern hydroelectric generator designs can be increased by using induction heating within penstocks and hydro turbines to boil and expand inlet water. The hydroturbine's electricity generation capabilities would power the induction heating surfaces to boiling temperatures. As the water reaches boiling temperatures as it drops from the penstock into the hydro turbine, it's expansion would increase the turbine speed at much greater velocities that the water would without expansion. This design is something that was developed from turbochargers used in automobiles.","topics":[],"score":186762,"global_rank":395385},{"name":"romjacket/mesen-s","owner":"romjacket","html_url":"https://github.com/romjacket/mesen-s","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"mesen-s","topics":[],"score":186760,"global_rank":395386},{"name":"pakalewis/CourseLister","owner":"pakalewis","html_url":"https://github.com/pakalewis/CourseLister","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Swift","description":null,"topics":[],"score":186758,"global_rank":395389},{"name":"cswiercz/resume","owner":"cswiercz","html_url":"https://github.com/cswiercz/resume","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"TeX","description":"My resume and curriculum vitae.","topics":[],"score":186758,"global_rank":395391},{"name":"nbren12/homework2","owner":"nbren12","html_url":"https://github.com/nbren12/homework2","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C","description":null,"topics":[],"score":186758,"global_rank":395404},{"name":"Randoramma/Pitch-Perfect","owner":"Randoramma","html_url":"https://github.com/Randoramma/Pitch-Perfect","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Swift","description":"This repository houses my iOS voice recorder project (Swift) ","topics":[],"score":186758,"global_rank":395409},{"name":"analogrelay/Phit","owner":"analog